{
    "word": "friendliness",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                "word": "friendliness",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2b4fce1d-fc20-47b2-99e3-974110504ade",
                        "entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "friendlinesses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
                        "entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality of being friendly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf858cb5-3755-4129-9538-f86ce8e1e6d9",
                                "sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
                                "text": "Finding us easy in our ways, he […] told me a cock-and-bull story with the moral of another five francs for the narrator. The thing was palpably absurd; but I paid up, and at once dropped all friendliness of manner, and kept him in his place as an inferior with freezing British dignity. He saw in a moment that he had gone too far, and killed a willing horse; his face fell; I am sure he would have refunded if he could only have thought of a decent pretext."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4729bae4-bba7-4cd8-9378-6d552a100f91",
                                "sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
                                "text": "To foreigners we often seem guileless and overchatty, an impression which is dispersed when they find that much of our friendliness is just the ebullition of the moment and does not carry with it any permanence of devotion."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "76d4f0e2-a3f1-40f1-9bbf-6d39115d4659",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
                        "source_sense_description": "the quality of being friendly",
                        "target_lang_word": "vriendelijkheid",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vriendelijkheid",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f154784-fcf5-30d5-b5ed-a82a8dcea79f",
                                        "entry_id": "b39ec926-8a56-39a5-9f28-019e041477e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het vriendelijk zijn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6c18046-2a2b-4385-8806-99d10bbc8201",
                                                "sense_id": "6f154784-fcf5-30d5-b5ed-a82a8dcea79f",
                                                "text": "Ik was overweldigd door hun vrijgevigheid en oprechte vriendelijkheid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14a4591c-07fd-4f84-895a-c82d23defb7b",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
                        "source_sense_description": "the quality of being friendly",
                        "target_lang_word": "gentillesse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gentillesse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ada4a935-135c-3d8e-9e00-21ab9f61db44",
                                        "entry_id": "d15975e0-4dad-3b9a-951f-0f790b727599",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Agrément accompagné de délicatesse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54059b9b-44b0-40b3-b535-46cb7b252856",
                                                "sense_id": "ada4a935-135c-3d8e-9e00-21ab9f61db44",
                                                "text": "Galamment, il lui baisa la main et badina un instant avec gentillesse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04368444-2138-46bc-bc5c-7037076cb32e",
                                                "sense_id": "ada4a935-135c-3d8e-9e00-21ab9f61db44",
                                                "text": "Cette gentillesse qui abrégeait les formes et supprimait les fadaises ridicules que tout garçon se croit tenu de débiter à la belle fille dont il essaie de faire sa maîtresse, m’avait séduit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8078cbe7-17da-4a39-866a-47981b53bbf6",
                                                "sense_id": "ada4a935-135c-3d8e-9e00-21ab9f61db44",
                                                "text": "Pour nombre de Saujonnais, Jeannette Grenon restera cette monitrice d’auto-école, connue pour sa grande gentillesse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91b5708c-8129-3f7a-b4f5-74302b0ba9c3",
                                        "entry_id": "d15975e0-4dad-3b9a-951f-0f790b727599",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tour de souplesse agréable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8794aa44-b17e-46e6-82e3-9855d12fcb6f",
                                                "sense_id": "91b5708c-8129-3f7a-b4f5-74302b0ba9c3",
                                                "text": "Il a dressé son chien à mille gentillesses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5622ec67-cec7-33ff-8dbf-5096d5852ea7",
                                        "entry_id": "d15975e0-4dad-3b9a-951f-0f790b727599",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Saillies agréables, spirituelles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ironic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "171c4e66-0339-48f6-ba3e-3ebebf853967",
                                                "sense_id": "5622ec67-cec7-33ff-8dbf-5096d5852ea7",
                                                "text": "Dire des gentillesses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "214f082a-a022-35b4-90fe-858d45b555f8",
                                        "entry_id": "d15975e0-4dad-3b9a-951f-0f790b727599",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Trait de mauvaise conduite, de malice, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ironic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c58a5644-bb35-485b-80bc-1ce400ecb0a3",
                                                "sense_id": "214f082a-a022-35b4-90fe-858d45b555f8",
                                                "text": "Il a fait là une gentillesse dont il pourrait bien se repentir. — Cette gentillesse est un peu forte."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "af797ad5-9bf6-43f6-9eaa-e71f786c6e66",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
                        "source_sense_description": "the quality of being friendly",
                        "target_lang_word": "cordialité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cordialité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7c94f75-353c-3afe-8823-f9af0789631f",
                                        "entry_id": "bb893b3f-690c-346b-9e85-12dfce28c585",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Affection dont les manifestations attestent la sincérité, la vivacité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2470dab5-4124-4573-b078-fafb34468f3c",
                                                "sense_id": "a7c94f75-353c-3afe-8823-f9af0789631f",
                                                "text": "La plus franche cordialité régnait entre nous. Je passai là d’excellentes heures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d38dab9b-6bd4-47b0-8bd6-9995dde452e1",
                                                "sense_id": "a7c94f75-353c-3afe-8823-f9af0789631f",
                                                "text": "Le bruit des voix, des carafes, des fourchettes, et des gosiers qui poussaient le bœuf vers les estomacs, cette rumeur de cordialité qui monte d’une table où les bonnes entrées n’empêchent pas les conversations, leur tapait un peu dans la tête."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bde5b34-f0f6-4cab-b000-188e115b82fa",
                                                "sense_id": "a7c94f75-353c-3afe-8823-f9af0789631f",
                                                "text": "Lorsqu’au bout de quelques semaines Elhamy la remercia, avec une cordialité souriante, du bien qu’elle avait fait à son fils, une émotion sourde étreignit sa gorge."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aede036d-058b-429d-8d96-fb9de0ab416e",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
                        "source_sense_description": "the quality of being friendly",
                        "target_lang_word": "Freundlichkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Freundlichkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c206e12-ad22-38ec-b42c-917782f1b1bb",
                                        "entry_id": "77fb2f66-647b-35a6-b64b-2dda0ca7688f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Liebenswürdigkeit, wohlwollende Geneigtheit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e65268c1-8194-4a89-8472-f8aab1271292",
                                                "sense_id": "3c206e12-ad22-38ec-b42c-917782f1b1bb",
                                                "text": "Ich möchte Ihnen danken, denn soviel Freundlichkeit bin ich von Fremden nicht gewohnt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d26908f9-5d09-404e-97d5-ef24db5cf62b",
                                                "sense_id": "3c206e12-ad22-38ec-b42c-917782f1b1bb",
                                                "text": "„Bald verwandelte sich die Freundlichkeit zu meinem Erstaunen in überschwängliche Vertraulichkeit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e81d5d6f-a334-4ead-92aa-9525d0fa3e3c",
                                                "sense_id": "3c206e12-ad22-38ec-b42c-917782f1b1bb",
                                                "text": "„Er bat schnell den Bekannten, der nicht sehr beglückt schien, um die Freundlichkeit, bei seinem Koffer einen Augenblick zu warten, überblickte noch die Situation, um sich bei der Rückkehr zurechtzufinden, und eilte davon.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88fdef06-b88b-4898-82d9-a2739a8fcf21",
                                                "sense_id": "3c206e12-ad22-38ec-b42c-917782f1b1bb",
                                                "text": "„In ihn hatte ich größeres Vertrauen, und ich beschloss, auf seine Freundlichkeit zu zählen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ad64ea1-33cb-4abb-8743-cf531a58353f",
                                                "sense_id": "3c206e12-ad22-38ec-b42c-917782f1b1bb",
                                                "text": "„Der Rektor empfing mich mit überströmender Freundlichkeit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dcbf7a5-259d-4c4c-9542-75dca622d6b0",
                                                "sense_id": "3c206e12-ad22-38ec-b42c-917782f1b1bb",
                                                "text": "„Freundlichkeit heißt, auf andere zuzugehen, ohne ihnen hinterher zu laufen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cb9c6a2-504b-43b5-8000-b6db9bca0b5f",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b894d40-4f89-3aef-b47f-a6c3d35dd893",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebfeb13d-e6dc-39bd-be40-e7fd311f4370",
